"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"96979","synopsis":"An introduction to Binchō-tan and her peaceful lifestyle. Binchō-tan rides a duck across a river and goes to collect wild vegetables.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qtnuHfk09zwzvh3znyCyJvtPs1D.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"An introduction to Binchō-tan and her peaceful lifestyle. Binchō-tan rides a duck across a river and goes to collect wild vegetables.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qtnuHfk09zwzvh3znyCyJvtPs1D.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeEndNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"96980","synopsis":"It is Binchō-tan's birthday and she receives gifts from her friend, Ubamega. She goes to town to look for work. On the way she hurts her knee and meets Chiku-tan, who tends to her wound. Chiku-tan is also looking for work. The two find jobs and go their separate ways. On the way home, Binchō-tan falls and spills her rice. Chiku-tan appears and helps her pick it up. She invites Binchō-tan back to her house for a surprise birthday party.\n\nThis episode also introduces Kunugi-tan, who watches Binchō-tan with interest, several times throughout the day.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmJcvwuRzJSSDmwK6RkXliUzuSm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"It is Binchō-tan's birthday and she receives gifts from her friend, Ubamega. She goes to town to look for work. On the way she hurts her knee and meets Chiku-tan, who tends to her wound. Chiku-tan is also looking for work. The two find jobs and go their separate ways. On the way home, Binchō-tan falls and spills her rice. Chiku-tan appears and helps her pick it up. She invites Binchō-tan back to her house for a surprise birthday party.\n\nThis episode also introduces Kunugi-tan, who watches Binchō-tan with interest, several times throughout the day.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmJcvwuRzJSSDmwK6RkXliUzuSm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeEndNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"96981","synopsis":"Chiku-tan has a new invention for reaching job flyers. She gets a job serving lunch at Kunugi-tan's school, but finds that it is for two days later, when she is meant to attend a fair. As the fair is the reason she wanted to earn money in the first place, she trades jobs with Binchō-tan, for a job a day earlier in a bakery. Binchō-tan is told that she must dress nicely for her job. While Chiku-tan works, Binchō-tan spends the next day washing her treasured kimono. She wears it proudly to work the next day, but it rains and Kunugi-tan's coach splashes her with mud. After a days work, she meets Kunugi-tan, who apologises and offers her money for a new kimono. Binchō-tan declines, as the kimono was a special gift from her grandmother. Chiku-tan attends the fair, only to find it is cancelled because of the rain.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rpDKr3vjZky04He7UBce3iQL2lX.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Chiku-tan has a new invention for reaching job flyers. She gets a job serving lunch at Kunugi-tan's school, but finds that it is for two days later, when she is meant to attend a fair. As the fair is the reason she wanted to earn money in the first place, she trades jobs with Binchō-tan, for a job a day earlier in a bakery. Binchō-tan is told that she must dress nicely for her job. While Chiku-tan works, Binchō-tan spends the next day washing her treasured kimono. She wears it proudly to work the next day, but it rains and Kunugi-tan's coach splashes her with mud. After a days work, she meets Kunugi-tan, who apologises and offers her money for a new kimono. Binchō-tan declines, as the kimono was a special gift from her grandmother. Chiku-tan attends the fair, only to find it is cancelled because of the rain.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rpDKr3vjZky04He7UBce3iQL2lX.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeEndNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"96982","synopsis":"Aroe is introduced. She has burst her paddling pool and decides to go to a swimming pool instead, but loses her entrance fee. Lightheaded from lack of water, she stumbles home but falls. Chiku-tan comes to her aid by pouring her grandfathers sake onto Aroe's head, which makes Aroe even dizzier. Chiku-tan and Chiku-rin make plans to attend a festival and meet Binchō-tan after she has finished her work for the day. Aroe also attends. Ren-tan has a fortune-telling booth. She tells Aroe's fortune and they meet up with Binchō-tan and the Chiku sisters and share some Ramune Ren-tan has won.\n\nKunugi-tan watches the festival from afar. As she is not able to attend, her butler goes to the festival and brings her back some Ramune.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/stcbz7b4e4HpOiynanoQOGJAvoO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Aroe is introduced. She has burst her paddling pool and decides to go to a swimming pool instead, but loses her entrance fee. Lightheaded from lack of water, she stumbles home but falls. Chiku-tan comes to her aid by pouring her grandfathers sake onto Aroe's head, which makes Aroe even dizzier. Chiku-tan and Chiku-rin make plans to attend a festival and meet Binchō-tan after she has finished her work for the day. Aroe also attends. Ren-tan has a fortune-telling booth. She tells Aroe's fortune and they meet up with Binchō-tan and the Chiku sisters and share some Ramune Ren-tan has won.\n\nKunugi-tan watches the festival from afar. As she is not able to attend, her butler goes to the festival and brings her back some Ramune.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/stcbz7b4e4HpOiynanoQOGJAvoO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeEndNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"96983","synopsis":"Binchō-tan goes to work at the school again and meets Kunugi-tan. While Kunugi-tan is teaching Binchō-tan to write, a beetle flies past and scares Kunugi-tan, who hates bugs. Later, a stag beetle attaches itself to Kunugi-tan's dress and Binchō-tan is not sure how to tell her without scaring her. To Binchō-tan's relief, it flies away before Kunugi-tan notices. The next day, Binchō-tan sends a letter to Kunugi-tan. Chiku-tan goes out to sell medicine on the street. She is having little success when Ren-tan arrives and shows her to a place that is better for business. She sells all of her wares and buys Ren-tan dango as a thank you gift. While they are eating it, the encounter Aroe, who is dizzy from lack of water again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vWBasRNwbWWoGePFn1Kd5ZzizDv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Binchō-tan goes to work at the school again and meets Kunugi-tan. While Kunugi-tan is teaching Binchō-tan to write, a beetle flies past and scares Kunugi-tan, who hates bugs. Later, a stag beetle attaches itself to Kunugi-tan's dress and Binchō-tan is not sure how to tell her without scaring her. To Binchō-tan's relief, it flies away before Kunugi-tan notices. The next day, Binchō-tan sends a letter to Kunugi-tan. Chiku-tan goes out to sell medicine on the street. She is having little success when Ren-tan arrives and shows her to a place that is better for business. She sells all of her wares and buys Ren-tan dango as a thank you gift. While they are eating it, the encounter Aroe, who is dizzy from lack of water again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vWBasRNwbWWoGePFn1Kd5ZzizDv.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeEndNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"750","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"106511","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"96984","synopsis":"Binchō-tan and Chiku-tan forage for berries, mushrooms and other things that grow in the forest to trade for food to store for winter and some winter clothes. They open up a stall which becomes very successful. Ren-tan uses her luck to help Chiku-tan win a bike in a raffle. As a thank you, Chiku-tan gives her some goggles. The next day, Ubamega sends Binchō-tan some New Year's gifts and it snows. Binchōtan, Chiku-tan, Chiku-rin and Ren-tan play in the snow and Chiku-tan discovers that skiing is not as easy as it looks. Kunugi-tan's father visits his daughter and they go on a hot-air balloon trip together. Binchōtan, Chiku-tan and Ren-tan take the bird bus so they can fly with her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wOvMHVXUb12QWr0JDshutyhEOaM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Binchō-tan and Chiku-tan forage for berries, mushrooms and other things that grow in the forest to trade for food to store for winter and some winter clothes. They open up a stall which becomes very successful. Ren-tan uses her luck to help Chiku-tan win a bike in a raffle. As a thank you, Chiku-tan gives her some goggles. The next day, Ubamega sends Binchō-tan some New Year's gifts and it snows. Binchōtan, Chiku-tan, Chiku-rin and Ren-tan play in the snow and Chiku-tan discovers that skiing is not as easy as it looks. Kunugi-tan's father visits his daughter and they go on a hot-air balloon trip together. Binchōtan, Chiku-tan and Ren-tan take the bird bus so they can fly with her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wOvMHVXUb12QWr0JDshutyhEOaM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":750,"malId":750},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:750","mal:750"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2836","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"750","ranges":{"1-12":"1-